  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">10 FOR 10 - Give 10 to Celebrate 10 Years</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In honor of Global Health Charities&apos; 10 year anniversary we are setting a goal of funding and assembling 10,000 Clean Birth Kits (CBKS). We are challenging our generous donors to help us celebrate by supporting us with a gift of 10 for 10. $10 for one CBK or $100 for 10 CBKs. Each CBK potentially saves the lives of a mother and her child. CBKs have been distributed globally to 19 countries in some of the most economically depressed countries as well as areas in conflict. .</narrative>
  </description>
